{"id": 1003730, "slug": "catgirl", "name": "Catgirl", "name_original": "Catgirl", "description": "<p>Welcome to Catgirl. In this RPG, you control a cat whose dog gets kidnapped by an evil demon queen. Now you must rescue your best friend... and maybe some other ppl too.</p><h3>features:</h3><ul><li><p>Story focused game play (but you can body slam absent fathers too).</p></li><li><p>Short &amp; sweet, just a couple hours.</p></li><li><p>Lots of mini-games</p></li><li><p>Charming original art and soundtrack..</p></li><li><p>Idiot-rich story with an emphasis on humor and pain.</p></li><li><p>Created by 3 people, that's over 2 brains worth of game.</p></li><li><p>Be friends with an orange doggy named Mopmop.</p></li><li><p>You can make beats with a caveman.</p></li><li><p>猫娘</p></li><li><p>There's a really handsome guy in the game</p></li><li><p>Sometimes i can't help but feel like a failure, no matter how hard i try</p></li><li><p>Super fun epic adventure filled with fantasy and friends!!!</p></li></ul>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-05-23", "tba": false, "updated": "2025-05-26T09:21:11", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/747/7476237cb5c23fe1d9ae2ab4a69d57b2.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/69c/69c8a4da51196428d534d3a4c70a0dff.jpg", "website": "", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [], "reactions": null, "added": 4, "added_by_status": {"yet": 1, "owned": 2, "toplay": 1}, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 5, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 0, "parent_achievements_count": 0, "reddit_url": "", "reddit_name": "", "reddit_description": "", "reddit_logo": "", "reddit_count": 0, "twitch_count": 0, "youtube_count": 0, "reviews_text_count": 0, "ratings_count": 0, "suggestions_count": 109, "alternative_names": [], "metacritic_url": "", "parents_count": 0, "additions_count": 0, "game_series_count": 0, "user_game": null, "reviews_cou